sed to the  right person and to me do you reflect on  the sacrifices they've made so that you  can live this life  that you're living now I think that  seriously and that's why every day I  wake up and and I think how can i what  can I do today to make myself better my  family better in my community the power  of a dream planted at a young age for  CBS this morning Saturday Jonathan  Vigliotti Los Angeles that's really  great to see isn't it I love the line  education being the most valuable  currency yeah so true and the idea that  a book can open up your mind yeah and  they do it together that that really  makes that makes the mark proud mom and  dad congratulations to all of them
 

